	(text "BRING-UP ORDER:\n1. Verify 9V_PD present before AP63203 powers up\n2. Check B+1 = 6.0-6.2V before enabling downstream\n3. Check B+3 = 10.5-11V (no load)\n4. Check +3.3V = 3.3V ±2%\n5. Do not connect WM-D6C harness until all rails verified"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 19.05 187.706 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "04892208-38cd-4827-b424-ad1372ce1091")
	)
	(text "Variant B input: 9V DC nominal, 5.5mm/2.1mm barrel jack.\nPolarity agnostic - bridge rectifier output is always positive.\nDo NOT connect a 6V adapter - minimum 7.5V required after\n0.8V bridge drop to maintain regulation headroom.\nSMBJ12A: standoff 12V, clamp 19.9V max. AP63203 VIN abs max 32V."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 202.946 47.244 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1f63162f-9828-4fa8-afad-dc7d8f9c4727")
	)
	(text "SEL pin sets PD voltage request - verify correct resistor value\nagainst IP2721 datasheet for 9V profile before ordering PCB.\nVBUSG must be tied to VIN. Floating VBUSG prevents output enable\nafter negotiation regardless of CC state."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
